! Parton level of the LHE events: no shower, no MPI, no primordial kT, no hadronisation.  The
! parton level itself stays on: with PartonLevel:all = off Pythia stops after the hard process and
! leaves the event record (which the analysis reads) empty.  Here the event record holds the hard
! process with its LHE kinematics, plus beam remnants without transverse momentum.
PartonLevel:ISR = off
PartonLevel:FSR = off
PartonLevel:MPI = off
BeamRemnants:primordialKT = off
HadronLevel:all = off
